{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01967","headline":"杂曲歌辞 昔昔盐 那能惜马蹏 · 赵嘏","name":"杂曲歌辞 昔昔盐 那能惜马蹏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"云中路杳杳，江畔草萋萋。\n妾久垂珠泪，君何惜马蹏。\n边风悲晓角，营月怨春鼙。\n未道休征战，愁眉又复低。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"赵嘏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01967.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01967","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}